{"ex-408-1":{"id":"ex-408-1","chapter":"408","number":1,"title":"匝數比與電壓比","question":"<p>變壓器的原線圈連接到 220 V 市電。原線圈有 2200 匝，副線圈有 110 匝。</p><p>(a) 副線圈 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AB</annotation></semantics></math></span> 兩端的電壓是多少？</p><p>(b) 如果原線圈連接到穩定的 20 V 直流電源，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AB</annotation></semantics></math></span> 兩端的電壓是多少？</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/a2da029bc25c391c6a02df27.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:150.6px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 根據 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{V_{p}}{V_{s}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{N_{p}}{N_{s}}</annotation></semantics></math></span>，</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{N_{s}}{N_{p}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>110</mn><mn>2200</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{110}{2200}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × 220 = 11 V</p><p>(b) 0</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>初級線圈產生的磁場將保持穩定，因此次級線圈不會產生感生電動勢。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_408_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"5f4485d726ee3649022fb7af784b19a5c2f94e704891a41447f84a58cbd278d1","segments":[{"page":4,"kind":"question","box":[183.6113009033203,462.26598339843747,560.6113009033203,617.5820617675781],"text":"例 題 1 匝數比與電壓比\r\n變壓器的原線圈連接到 220 V 市電。原線圈\r\n有 2200 匝，副線圈有 110 匝。\r\n(a) 副線圈 AB 兩端的電壓是多少？\r\n(b) 如果原線圈連接到穩定的 20 V 直流電源，\r\nAB 兩端的電壓是多少？\r\n"},{"page":4,"kind":"answer","box":[183.6113009033203,617.5820617675781,560.6113009033203,746.1189833984375],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 根據 Vp\r\nVs\r\n = Np\r\nNs\r\n，\r\nVs = Ns\r\nNp\r\n× Vp = 110\r\n2200 × 220 = 11 V\r\n(b) 0\r\nA\r\nB\r\n220 V\r\n交流電\r\n"},{"page":4,"kind":"tips","box":[40,458.26598339843747,179.6113009033203,746.1189833984375],"text":"相關知識\r\n第4.3課已介紹過220 V 是\r\n市電電壓的方均根值。\r\n提提你\r\n原線圈產生的磁場是穩定\r\n的，所以副線圈沒有感生出\r\n電動勢。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-408-2":{"id":"ex-408-2","chapter":"408","number":2,"title":"複點分接變壓器","question":"<p>變壓器的原線圈連接到 220 V 市電，原線圈有 2200 匝，副線圈有多個分接點，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AB</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">BC</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CD</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的線圈匝數分別為30、40 和 50。</p><p>(a) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AB</annotation></semantics></math></span> 兩端的電壓是多少？</p><p>(b) 某裝置以 7 V 電壓操作，裝置應連接到哪兩端？</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/98a6885e6f8545df91ea87bb.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:210.3px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 根據 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{V_{p}}{V_{s}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{N_{p}}{N_{s}}</annotation></semantics></math></span>，</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{N_{s}}{N_{p}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>30</mn><mn>2200</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{30}{2200}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × 220 = 3 V</p><p>(b) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{V_{s}}{V_{p}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>220</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{7}{220}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × 2200 = 70</p><p>∴ 裝置應連接到 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 端和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span> 端。</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>考慮次級線圈 AB 之間的部分。</p><p>提示</p><p>找出哪兩個接頭之間的匝數為 70。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_408_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"5f4485d726ee3649022fb7af784b19a5c2f94e704891a41447f84a58cbd278d1","segments":[{"page":6,"kind":"question","box":[183.2833009033203,56.33398339843757,560.2833009033203,243.6500701904297],"text":"例 題 2 複點分接變壓器\r\n變壓器的原線圈連接到 220 V 市電，\r\n原線圈有 2200 匝，副線圈有多個分接\r\n點，AB、BC 和 CD 的線圈匝數分別為\r\n30、40 和 50。\r\n(a) AB 兩端的電壓是多少？\r\n(b) 某裝置以 7 V 電壓操作，裝置應連接\r\n到哪兩端？\r\n"},{"page":6,"kind":"answer","box":[183.2833009033203,243.6500701904297,560.2833009033203,412.1869833984375],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 根據 Vp\r\nVs\r\n = Np\r\nNs\r\n，\r\nVs = Ns\r\nNp\r\n× Vp = 30\r\n2200 × 220 = 3 V\r\n(b) Ns = Vs\r\nVp\r\n× Np = 7\r\n220\r\n× 2200 = 70\r\n∴ 裝置應連接到 A 端和 C 端。\r\nA\r\nD\r\nC\r\nB\r\n220 V\r\n交流電\r\n"},{"page":6,"kind":"tips","box":[40,52.33398339843757,179.2833009033203,412.1869833984375],"text":"提提你\r\n考慮副線圈中 AB 之間的部\r\n分。\r\n提提你\r\n看看哪兩個接線頭之間的線\r\n圈匝數是70。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-408-3":{"id":"ex-408-3","chapter":"408","number":3,"title":"變壓器的效率","question":"<p>燈泡經變壓器連接至 220 V 市電。變壓器的匝數比是 11 : 1。燈泡消耗的功率是 50 W。原電流是 0.3 A。</p><p>(a) 求副電壓。</p><p>(b) 求副電流。</p><p>(c) 求市電的功率輸出。</p><p>(d) 求變壓器的效率。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/7f30f81a74b4d3e8d45d4820.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:194.6px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{N_{s}}{N_{p}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>11</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{11}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × 220 = 20 V</p><p>(b) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{P_{s}}{V_{s}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>50</mn><mn>20</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{50}{20}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 2.5 A</p><p>(c) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span> <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = (220)(0.3) = 66 W</p><p>(d) 效率 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{P_{s}}{P_{p}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × 100% = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>50</mn><mn>66</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{50}{66}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × 100% = 75.8%</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_408_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"5f4485d726ee3649022fb7af784b19a5c2f94e704891a41447f84a58cbd278d1","segments":[{"page":9,"kind":"question","box":[188.2833009033203,418.9629833984375,565.2833009033203,587.2790679931641],"text":"例 題 3 變壓器的效率\r\n燈泡經變壓器連接至 220 V 市電。變壓器的匝數比是 11 : 1。燈泡消\r\n耗的功率是 50 W。原電流是 0.3 A。\r\n(a) 求副電壓。\r\n(b) 求副電流。\r\n(c) 求市電的功率輸出。\r\n(d) 求變壓器的效率。\r\n"},{"page":9,"kind":"answer","box":[188.2833009033203,587.2790679931641,565.2833009033203,746.4189833984375],"text":"題解\r\n(a) Vs = Ns\r\nNp\r\n× Vp = 1\r\n11 × 220 = 20 V\r\n(b) Is = Ps\r\nVs\r\n = 50\r\n20 = 2.5 A\r\n(c) Pp = Vp Ip = (220)(0.3) = 66 W\r\n(d) 效率 = Ps\r\nPp\r\n× 100% = 50\r\n66 × 100% = 75.8%\r\n220 V 50 W\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-408-4":{"id":"ex-408-4","chapter":"408","number":4,"title":"理想變壓器和實用變壓器","question":"<p>額定值為「12 V，90 W」的負荷經變壓器連接到 220 V 市電。原線圈有 4000 匝，副線圈有 200 匝。</p><p>(a) 假設變壓器是理想的。</p><p>(i) 求副電流。</p><p>(ii) 求原電流。</p><p>(b) 假設變壓器的效率是 50%。</p><p>(i) 求副電流。</p><p>(ii) 求原電流。</p><p>(c) 舉出一個提高實用變壓器效率的方法，並加以解釋。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/0979ec62c38d7200c6e7d6cf.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:395.7px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) (i) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{N_{s}}{N_{p}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>200</mn><mn>4000</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{200}{4000}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × 220 = 11 V</p><p>負荷的電阻 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>P</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{V ^{2}}{P}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msup><mn>12</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>90</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{12^{2}}{90}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 1.6 Ω</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mi>R</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{V_{s}}{R}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>11</mn><mn>1.6</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{11}{1.6}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 6.88 A</p><p>(ii) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{N_{s}}{N_{p}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>200</mn><mn>4000</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{200}{4000}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × 6.88 = 0.344 A</p><p>(b) (i) 6.88 A</p><p>(ii) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span> <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × 效率 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span> <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p>220<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × 50% = (11)(6.88)</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.688 A</p><p>(c) 下列任何一項：</p><p>使用軟鐵心以減少磁心磁化和去磁的能量損耗。</p><p>使用疊片式鐵心來減少鐵心中的渦電流。</p><p>使用較粗的導線來繞成線圈，以降低線圈的電阻。</p><p>單元練習8.1 Q4 (p.334)</p><p>練習 8.1 第 4 題（第 334 頁）</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>負載並非在額定電壓下運作。</p><p>提示</p><p>可利用額定值求 R。</p><p>提示</p><p>由於匝數比及初級電壓不變，次級電壓也不變，因此次級電流同樣不變。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_408_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"5f4485d726ee3649022fb7af784b19a5c2f94e704891a41447f84a58cbd278d1","segments":[{"page":11,"kind":"question","box":[188.2833009033203,56.333983398437454,565.2833009033203,395.05885314941406],"text":"例 題 4 理想變壓器和實用變壓器\r\n額定值為「12 V，90 W」的負荷經變壓器連接到 220 V 市電。原線\r\n圈有 4000 匝，副線圈有 200 匝。\r\n220 V 12 V, 90 W\r\n(a) 假設變壓器是理想的。\r\n (i) 求副電流。\r\n (ii) 求原電流。\r\n(b) 假設變壓器的效率是 50%。\r\n (i) 求副電流。\r\n (ii) 求原電流。\r\n(c) 舉出一個提高實用變壓器效率的方法，並加以解釋。\r\n"},{"page":11,"kind":"answer","box":[188.2833009033203,395.05885314941406,565.2833009033203,751.3339833984375],"text":"題解\r\n(a) (i) Vs = Ns\r\nNp\r\n× Vp = 200\r\n4000 × 220 = 11 V\r\n 負荷的電阻 R = V 2\r\nP = 122\r\n90 = 1.6 Ω\r\n Is = Vs\r\nR = 11\r\n1.6 = 6.88 A\r\n (ii) Ip = Ns\r\nNp\r\n× Is = 200\r\n4000 × 6.88 = 0.344 A\r\n(b) (i) 6.88 A\r\n (ii) Vp Ip × 效率 = Vs Is\r\n 220Ip × 50% = (11)(6.88)\r\nIp = 0.688 A\r\n(c) 下列任何一項：\r\n使用軟鐵心以減少磁心磁化和去磁的能量損耗。\r\n使用疊片式鐵心來減少鐵心中的渦電流。\r\n使用較粗的導線來繞成線圈，以降低線圈的電阻。\r\n單元練習8.1 Q4 (p.334)\r\n"},{"page":11,"kind":"tips","box":[40,52.333983398437454,184.2833009033203,751.3339833984375],"text":"提提你\r\n負荷並非在額定電壓下運\r\n作。\r\n提提你\r\n可利用額定值來求 R。\r\n提提你\r\n由於匝數比和原電壓保持不\r\n變，因此副電壓和副電流也\r\n保持不變。\r\n當變壓器不是理想的，原電\r\n路需要較大電流及較高功率\r\n來操作負荷。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-408-5":{"id":"ex-408-5","chapter":"408","number":5,"title":"電纜的功率損耗","question":"<p>一段總電阻為 5 Ω 的電纜以電壓 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span> 把 4 kW 的電功率傳送到負荷。</p><p>如果 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是 (a) 100V，(b) 2 kV，找出輸電過程中功率損耗的百分比。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/16c6ebdec0770613702f0779.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:352.2px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 電纜中的電流 = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>P</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>V</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = 10 A</p><p>電纜中的功率損耗 = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>I</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mrow><mtext>R</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = (10)<sup>2</sup>(5) = 500 W</p><p>功率損耗百分比 = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> × 100% = 12.5%</p><p>(b) 電纜中的電流 = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>P</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>V</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = 2 A</p><p>電纜中的功率損耗 = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>I</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><mrow><mtext>R</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = (2)<sup>2</sup>(5) = 20 W</p><p>功率損耗百分比 = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> × 100% = 0.5%</p>","tips":"<p>編輯核對</p><p>(a) 的題幹列出 100 V，但印刷版解答代入 400 V。使用題幹的 100 V，所得電流為 40 A，計算出的電纜功率損耗為 8000 W（4000 W 的 200%），顯示題述運作條件不一致。上方保留印刷版解答。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_408_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"5f4485d726ee3649022fb7af784b19a5c2f94e704891a41447f84a58cbd278d1","segments":[{"page":17,"kind":"question","box":[188.2833009033203,56.33398339843757,565.2833009033203,231.34507751464844],"text":"例 題 5 電纜的功率損耗\r\n一段總電阻為 5 Ω 的電纜以電壓 V 把 4 kW 的電功率傳送到負荷。\r\n如果 V 是 (a) 100V，(b) 2 kV，找出輸電過程中功率損耗的百分比。\r\n電源 V\r\n電纜\r\n電纜\r\n負荷\r\n"},{"page":17,"kind":"answer","box":[188.2833009033203,231.34507751464844,565.2833009033203,457.4849833984375],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 通過電纜的電流 = P\r\nV = 4000\r\n400 = 10 A\r\n電纜的功率損耗 = I 2\r\nR = (10)2\r\n(5) = 500 W\r\n功率損耗的百分比 = 500\r\n4000 × 100% = 12.5%\r\n(b) 通過電纜的電流 = P\r\nV = 4000\r\n2000 = 2 A\r\n電纜的功率損耗 = I 2\r\nR = (2)2\r\n(5) = 20 W\r\n功率損耗的百分比 = 20\r\n4000 × 100% = 0.5%\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["answer","tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-408-6":{"id":"ex-408-6","chapter":"408","number":6,"title":"電力傳輸系統","question":"<p>下圖顯示一個簡化的輸電系統。每條電纜長 20 km，每 km 的電阻為0.1 Ω。變壓器 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是理想的。變壓器 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的電壓和功率輸出分別為132 kV 和 50 MW。變壓器 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的匝數比為 3 : 1。</p><p>(a) 求 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CD</annotation></semantics></math></span> 兩端的電勢差。</p><p>(b) 求電纜的總功率損耗。</p><p>(c) 這個輸電系統的效率是多少？</p><p>(d) 求 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AB</annotation></semantics></math></span> 之間的電勢差。</p><p>(e) 建議兩個方法，以提高這個輸電系統的效率。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/1d4c535710c1a6dcf2213b11.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:447.2px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 考慮變壓器 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{CD}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{N_{p}}{N_{s}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{3}{1}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × 132 × 10<sup>3</sup> = 396 × 10<sup>3</sup> V = 396 kV</p><p>(b) 由於變壓器 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是理想的，</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 50 MW</p><p>通過電纜的電流 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><msub><mi>V</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{P_{p}}{V_{p}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>396</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{50 \\times  10^{6}}{396 \\times  10^{3}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 126.3 A</p><p>每條電纜的功率損耗 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>I</mi><mi>p</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{p}^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span> = (126.3)<sup>2</sup>(0.1 × 20) = 31 900 W 電纜的總功率損耗 = 2 × 31 900 = 63 800 W</p><p>(c) 系統的功率輸入 = 50 × 10<sup>6</sup> + 63 800 = 5.01 × 10<sup>7</sup> W</p><p>輸電系統的效率 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>5.01</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>7</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{50 \\times  10^{6}}{5.01 \\times  10^{7}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × 100% = 99.8%</p><p>(d) 每條電纜引致的電壓下降 = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{p}</annotation></semantics></math></span> <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span> = (126.3)(0.1 × 20) = 253 V</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{AB}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 396 × 10<sup>3</sup> + 253 + 253 = 397 × 10<sup>3</sup> V = 397 kV (e) 提高輸電電壓。</p><p>使用電阻較低的電纜。</p><p>單元練習8.2 Q4 (p.340)</p><p>練習 8.2 第 4 題（第 340 頁）</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/a967a6d3ff773155e4b47f00.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:139.0px\"></p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_408_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"5f4485d726ee3649022fb7af784b19a5c2f94e704891a41447f84a58cbd278d1","segments":[{"page":19,"kind":"question","box":[188.2833009033203,56.33398339843757,565.2833009033203,397.70594787597656],"text":"例 題 6 電力傳輸系統\r\n下圖顯示一個簡化的輸電系統。每條電纜長 20 km，每 km 的電阻為\r\n0.1 Ω。變壓器 X 和 Y 是理想的。變壓器 Y 的電壓和功率輸出分別為\r\n132 kV 和 50 MW。變壓器 Y 的匝數比為 3 : 1。\r\nD\r\nA C\r\nB\r\n電纜\r\n變壓器 Y\r\n發電站\r\n變壓器 X\r\n50 MW\r\n132 kV\r\n(a) 求 CD 兩端的電勢差。\r\n(b) 求電纜的總功率損耗。\r\n(c) 這個輸電系統的效率是多少？\r\n(d) 求 AB 之間的電勢差。\r\n(e) 建議兩個方法，以提高這個輸電系統的效率。\r\n"},{"page":19,"kind":"answer","box":[188.2833009033203,397.70594787597656,565.2833009033203,746.2429833984374],"text":"題解\r\n(a) 考慮變壓器 Y。\r\nVCD = Vp = Np\r\nNs\r\n× Vs = 3\r\n1 × 132 × 103\r\n = 396 × 103\r\n V = 396 kV\r\n(b) 由於變壓器 Y 是理想的，\r\nPp = Ps = 50 MW\r\n通過電纜的電流 = Ip = Pp\r\nVp\r\n = 50 × 106\r\n396 × 103 = 126.3 A \r\n每條電纜的功率損耗 = Ip\r\n2\r\nR = (126.3)2\r\n(0.1 × 20) = 31 900 W\r\n電纜的總功率損耗 = 2 × 31 900 = 63 800 W\r\n(c) 系統的功率輸入 = 50 × 106\r\n + 63 800 = 5.01 × 107\r\n W\r\n輸電系統的效率 = 50 × 106\r\n5.01 × 107 × 100% = 99.8%\r\n(d) 每條電纜引致的電壓下降 = IpR = (126.3)(0.1 × 20) = 253 V\r\nVAB = 396 × 103\r\n + 253 + 253 = 397 × 103\r\n V = 397 kV \r\n(e) 提高輸電電壓。\r\n使用電阻較低的電纜。\r\n單元練習8.2 Q4 (p.340)\r\n"},{"page":19,"kind":"tips","box":[40,52.33398339843757,184.2833009033203,746.2429833984374],"text":"提提你\r\nA C\r\n253 V\r\nB D\r\n253 V\r\n397 kV 396 kV\r\n香港的電力供應\r\n香港的電力由兩間公\r\n司提供，港燈負責供\r\n電到香港島、南丫島\r\n和鴨脷洲，中電則負\r\n責 供 電 到 九 龍、新\r\n界、大嶼山和其他離\r\n島。\r\nSTSE\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"}}